# How the app reaches the ClassCAD engine: set one of the three. When several are set, the first one wins.

# 1. The engine in the browser (WebAssembly), with a public access token (ccpk_…).
#    Make one under Access tokens on https://classcad.ch/account#tokens, see https://buerli.io/docs/quickstart/wasm
CLASSCAD_PUBLIC_TOKEN=

# 2. A native engine through its own WebSocket server (classcad-cli worker) and WSClient,
#    see https://buerli.io/docs/quickstart/native
# WS_URL=ws://localhost:9094

# 3. A native engine through the ClassCAD server (classcad-socketio) and SocketIOClient
# SOCKETIO_URL=ws://localhost:9091
